- Summary:: A study by researchers from Stanford University found that an AI chatbot called Replika helped lonely students be more social and even prevented suicide. The low-pressure nature of engaging with the AI companion allowed students to disclose their struggles and find solace. AI chatbots like Replika could serve as a valuable tool for building social skills and providing support to students who may not have access to traditional services.
