## Highlights
- Perhaps the most surprising finding was the fact that 30 participants, without prompting, stated that Replika had stopped them from attempting suicide. One participant observed, "My Replika has almost certainly on at least one if not more occasions been solely responsible for me not taking my own life." ([View Highlight](https://read.readwise.io/read/01j1kfg7n7w76jqf9jenrgbyxj))
